Subject: [PATCH 2/5] build(bazel): expose opensovd_core's tokio and serde_json
Eclipse SDV Hackathon Chapter 4 - 2026


Apply the existing expose-tokio patch and add the same for serde_json, so
code linking diag_api and opensovd_core can name opensovd's crate instances.
Add async-trait to score_crate_index.

